LRtriple(...,RandomSeed=>...) -- option to set the seed of the random number generators.
****************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        LRtriple(...,RandomSeed=>ZZ)

Description
===========

Use RandomSeed=>12345 to set the seed to 12345. This can be used to make the
generation of random flas deterministic and hence reproducible.

