RandomSeed -- seed for the random number generators.
****************************************************

Description
===========

To avoid singularities during complex path following, the homotopy methods use
a random constant. The flags generated in *note LRtriple: LRtriple, also depend
on the values generated by the random number generator. Fixing the value of
RandomSeed leads to reproducible runs.

Functions with optional argument named RandomSeed:
==================================================

  * *note LRtriple(...,RandomSeed=>...):
    LRtriple_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmRandomSeed=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- option to set the seed
    of the random number generators.

For the programmer
==================

The object *note RandomSeed: RandomSeed, is a *note symbol:
(Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

