===================

  * Default value: *note true: (Macaulay2Doc)true,
  * Function: *note solveSchubertProblem: solveSchubertProblem, -- uses
    Littlewood-Richardson homotopy algorithm to solve a Schubert problem
  * Option key: *note LinearAlgebra: (Macaulay2Doc)Gröbner basis algorithms,
